### Foods — search, get, barcode, submit. Set @host from the Aspire dashboard's "api" endpoint.
@host = https://localhost:7443
@subject = demo-user

### Search the verification-tiered catalog (Redis-cached). The dev seeder includes "egg".
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/search?q=egg
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### Get one food by id
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/REPLACE-WITH-FOOD-ID
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### Barcode lookup (returns the lowest-tier match for a GTIN)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/foods/barcode/0123456789012
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}

### Submit a user food (lands at the user-submitted tier; audited)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/foods
X-Debug-Subject: {{subject}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Homemade granola",
  "brand": null,
  "gtin": null,
  "kcalPer100g": 471,
  "proteinPer100g": 10.0,
  "fatPer100g": 20.0,
  "carbPer100g": 64.0,
  "portions": [{ "name": "1/2 cup", "grams": 60 }]
}
